rem            from an earlier build needs one rename to unsc marine armor face.shader_model
rem            - same folder, same contents, no Guerilla work and no new bitmap.
rem            And the map: a .map carries its own copy of every tag it draws - the
rem            model, its shader references, the bitmap pixels - packed in when it was
rem            built, so a newer model tag changes nothing the game shows. Compile the
rem            model, then build the map again. "Check the shaders.bat" now also says
rem            when a tag is there under the right name and the wrong spelling.
